A||||3||Robert||The great 1.5 second race…….||||10||
Z||000000||Robert||08-01-2001||02:59 PM||||My wife and I were on our way out to dinner last night in old “Thunder” when much to my surprise, a “Pocket Rocket” (Something like a 600 with an R, but really don’t know) decided to beat us to the next light.  <BR> Now here we are waiting at a left turn light, (double lane) when he pulls up on the right, fully decked out with matching leathers and helmet.  The two turning lanes merge down to one lane after crossing 3 lanes of oncoming traffic.  I look at him click into first gear, as the light turns orange from the other direction.  I rev “Thunder” (Auto) up to 2,000 RPM with my foot firmly on the break. My wife now says “ROBERT, don’t you dare”…. But just a second to late.  I know there is no way that bike is going to keep the front wheel on the ground under hard acceleration to make the turn. Light turns green; I jump off the line right as he is smoking his tires and starting to do a wheel stand.  Needless to say, I beat him through the turn and up to the next light.  You would have enjoyed watching him trying to negotiate a hard left turn while the front wheel was two feet above the ground.  I never went above 30 mph, but it was a nice race just the same. The light was red at the next intersection, so he pulls up along side of us.  Won’t even look at us.  Light turns green and he is gone in a flash.  I pull out slowly with my wife telling me NEVER to do that again with her in the passenger seat.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://canterburytrails.com/photo/T2.GIF">   <P> "By the time you die, you should be so used to <BR>paying taxes that it would be almost second nature <BR>to you."||||reg||10
Z||000001||onfire||08-01-2001||03:16 PM||||That's the funniest thing I heard all day.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/onfiresig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Bluebottlejunky||08-01-2001||05:53 PM||||hahaha! that is great man!..scared the wife eh? Lets hope your not sleeping on the coutch tonight  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Hello, My name is Mike and I am addicted too fiero's...PLEASE dont help me.<BR>85'GT 4sp<BR>AIM: Fierofanatic2001||||reg||1
Z||000003||artherd||08-02-2001||04:15 AM||||Heh, bikes scare me (but I still want a 748 Ducati, or maybe I'll go full 996 :) <P>That guy didn't know how to ride.  He could have idled through the turn, then stood on it, and been gone through both lights...<P>Motorcycles are ungodly fast.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
